    user_query: Find video scenes featuring bicycle brands and their key features
    text_sources:
        - "furo.json: Scene from 00:00:12 - 00:00:17 shows a man walking with a Furo Systems bicycle in an urban residential area, with the Furo Systems logo displayed prominently. Scene from 00:00:45 - 00:00:46 features close-up of bicycle's hydraulic disk brakes with text 'TEKTRO HYDRAULIC DISK BRAKES'."
        - "huawei.json: Scene from 00:00:07 - 00:00:10 displays a person checking their Huawei smartwatch for activity tracking data while walking outside. Scene from 00:00:41 - 00:00:44 shows person exercising at home with dog while smartwatch displays heart rate, duration, and calories burned."
        - "tropicfeel.json: Scene from 00:00:03 - 00:00:04 demonstrates Hive backpack being packed with clothes and camera equipment, emphasizing storage capabilities. Scene from 00:02:23 - 00:02:27 shows woman demonstrating laptop compartment feature while sitting on bench."
